      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't agree with this change, not as a mandatory thing at least. I may not personally care for flair, but I know others do. You're effectively saying \"Remove the ways that people can pop out because I think they will all be snobs and get targeted by hackers\". That is incredibly short sighted. You'll need to give a better reason than personal speculation and worry if you want this change to be a thing.\nIf someone gets snobby with you and starts acting like a prick because they are paying for the game, and you think its genuinely harming you or your peers, use the report feature and block them. That's what it was made for. Don't call for a core perk being removed because of that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
