      "value": "This is going to get me some flack but I'm sorry to say, vrc+ users ARE the ones footing the bill, they are better than someone who is just freeloading on the service (and I'm a freeloader currently).\nI do agree that plus users should have the option to hide their status if they so desire, just like user ranks.",
