      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Going by this logic, you'd have to disallow the use of Full Body Tracking users aswell. Because they could also be \"snobby\" about it.\nFunFact and i have nothing against any groups or individual, usually its Quest users that harass FBT users for spending so much money.\nIt happens and we or most of us just accept it and don't even take it serious to be honest. If anything i would love FBT to be more available for more people someday soon. It is a whole different experience.\nI've been in Half Body for over 5 years myself before i saved up enough money for FBT.",
