      "value": "@{60a61b373332241d8a817fb7|full_name}: VRChat doesn't make any of the models you use so saying its users who don't want to pay are freeloaders is a good joke guy. you know nothing about the dynamics going on if you believe this crappy subscription is helping them get by. They are given millions of dollars for just having the platform from very large companies already which indirectly sells VR headsets. The games a cash cow for marketing. Them not offering standard features is huge fuck you to the players when its behind a paywall.",
